<view class="page">
  <view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s06-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title"><view class="top-title-main">描述症状</view><view class="top-title-sub">第 3 步，共 4 步</view></view><view class="top-action" bindtap="save">保存草稿</view></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:75%"></view></view>
  <view class="notice notice-red" style="margin-top:38rpx"><image class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s06-imgFrame1.svg"/>出现呼吸困难等危险信号，立即中断并求助</view>
  <view class="h2" style="margin-top:54rpx">现在主要有哪些表现？</view><view class="muted">可多选，选择当前实际出现的情况</view>
  <view class="chip-row" style="margin-top:28rpx"><view wx:for="{{options}}" wx:key="label" class="chip {{item.selected?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item.label}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.selected?'✓ ':''}}{{item.label}}</view></view>
  <view class="section-title"><text>影响范围</text><text class="aside">单选</text></view><view class="choice-grid"><view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{range===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="setRange">{{item}}</view></view>
  <view class="section-title"><text>症状变化</text><text class="aside">与刚发生时相比</text></view><view class="choice-grid"><view wx:for="{{trends}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{trend===item?'active':''}} {{item==='逐渐加重'&&trend===item?'danger':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="setTrend">{{item}}</view></view>
  <view class="card card-pad row" style="margin-top:48rpx" bindtap="addPhoto"><image wx:if="{{photo}}" class="photo-thumb" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="circle circle-green" style="width:80rpx;height:80rpx"><image class="figma-icon md" src="/assets/figma/all/s06-img1.svg"/></view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:24rpx"><view>添加现场或皮肤照片</view><view class="tiny">选填，仅用于记录变化，不进行疾病诊断</view></view><text class="muted">添加</text></view>
  <button class="secondary-btn" style="margin-top:48rpx" bindtap="next">生成安全建议</button><button class="primary-btn" style="margin-top:20rpx" bindtap="save">已自动保存 · 离线可继续</button><view class="safe-note" style="margin-top:20rpx">返回时保留已填内容</view>
</view>
